     If you #chat to your quest leader while carrying the quest
artifact, you'll be told that you should keep it (and the game
will recognize that you've completed the quest).  Alternatively,
you can throw it at the leader; that will also trigger quest
completion and the item will be put back into your inventory.
But on general principles I'd suggest not getting into the habit
of doing that; it's too easy to make a typo when selecting
the object to throw....

     It isn't required that quest completion be acknowledged.
As long as you've acquired the other special item that the
nemesis was guarding, you don't need to do anything else
in the quest branch of the dungeon.



